  +:leach(Employee, Ada)
  +:shakeZ(Ada)
  Ada: "I was told this was an <italic>Arcade</>?"
  Employee: "Yep. The <color=LIGHTBLUE>Regem Ludos Arcade</>."
  +:teardrop(Ada)
  +:ld(Ada, leftup)
  +:w(300)
  +:ld(Ada, rightup)
  +:w(300)
  +:ld(Ada, right)
  Ada: "But it is just a room...?"
  +:leach(Ada, Employee)
  Employee: "The <italic>arcade</> is actually a <color=PURPLE>Revirtualis</>.  You know, like virtual reality?"
  Ada: "<cascade-letters>Oh....\nI see."
  +walkToOffset(Ada, 6, 6)
  +:angry(Ada)
  +endConversation(100)
  +setConversation2('', Ada)
  Ada: "That idiot!  He neglected to mention that!"
  +:none()
  +:ld(Ada, leftdown)
  +:shakeZ(Ada)
  +:w(1000)
  Ada: "Of course he did it on purpose!"
  Ada: "You know <color=YELLOW>Father</> does not want us cavorting about some random <color=PURPLE>Revirtualis</>!"
  +:none()
  +:w(2000)
  +:serious(Ada)
  Ada: "I would <shake>never</> have agreed to come if I had known about this."
  +endConversation(100)
  +setConversation(Ada)
  +:shakeZ(Employee)
  Employee: "Uh... I'm sorry?  Are you talking to me?"
  +:angry(Ada)
  +:ld(Ada, down)
  +:ld(Ada, right)
  +:la(Ada, Employee)
  Ada: "No.  I am speaking with <color=YELLOW>Conscience</>.  Please do not interrupt."
  +none()
  +:ld(Ada, right)
  +:ld(Ada, leftdown)
  +endConversation(100)
  +setConversation2('', Ada)
  +:w(1000)
  Ada: "No, I am not planning to leave... I said I would come."
  Ada: "But I have a bad feeling about this."
  +:none()
  +:w(1000)
  Ada: "<cascade-letters>Fine..."
  +none()
  +endConversation(100)
  +setConversationGroup(Ada, Employee)
  +walkToOffset(Ada, -8, -8)
  +:leach(Ada, Employee)
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(500, false, Ada, Employee)
  +:shakeZ(Ada)
  Ada: "Very well, how do I proceed?"
  +:ld(Employee, down)
  Employee: "<cascade-letters>Ookaay...."
