  Employee: "Hmm.  'Adalais Eldridge'?  Is that right?"
  Ada: "<italic>Ada</>, if you please."
  Employee: "'Eldridge' as in the famous AI guy <color=ORANGE>Dalton Eldridge</>?  Any relation?"
  +:teardrop(Ada)
  +:ld(Ada, rightdown)
  Ada: "Actually, yes. He is my father."
  +:leach(Employee, Ada)
  +:shakeZ(Employee)
  Employee: "Aha!  I knew he had a daughter that goes to <color=PURPLE>Erran Valley High School</>.  It makes sense you would come here."
