  +:shakeZ(Employee)
  Employee: "Alright, since you're from <color=PURPLE>Erran Valley High School</>, you probably already know the drill."
  Employee: "It's just like the <color=PURPLE>Revirtualis</> you use at school.  So just stand still and I'll beam you in."
  Employee: "Oh and we've been having a few issues with some of the <italic>monsters</> lately, so, you know, just try to be a little careful."
